---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
navKey: home
altHref: /
title: "Ofir Omer, Adv. | Litigation, Commercial Law & Real Estate"
description: "Ofir Omer, Adv. — legal counsel and representation in civil-commercial litigation, real estate, contracts, corporate matters, and property management. Personal, professional, and strategic representation."
---
<section class="container hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <span class="eyebrow">Ofir Omer, Adv.</span>
    <h1>Law. Strategy. Results.</h1>
    <p>A boutique firm specializing in legal counsel, civil-commercial litigation, and representation of companies, business owners, and private clients in complex legal matters.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/contact/">Contact Us</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/practice-areas/">Practice Areas</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__portrait">
    <img src="{{ site.portraitLarge }}" alt="Ofir Omer, Adv.">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container two-col">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Experience & Expertise</span>
      <h2>Legal knowledge paired with business thinking</h2>
      <p>The firm advises companies, business owners, and private clients on complex legal matters, combining precise legal understanding with strategic thinking tailored to each client's goals.</p>
      <a class="card__link" href="/en/about/">About Ofir Omer, Adv.</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Professional Approach</span>
      <h2>Personal involvement in every case</h2>
      <p>Every case receives personal, direct attention from the attorney himself — availability, discretion, and attentiveness throughout the entire process.</p>
      <a class="card__link" href="/en/contact/">Schedule a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Core Practice Areas</span>
    <h2>Practice Areas</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for area in practiceAreas %}
      <article class="card">
        <h3 class="card__title">{{ area.title_en }}</h3>
        <p>{{ area.short_en }}</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/en/practice-areas/{{ area.slug }}/">Read More</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Selected Cases</span>
    <h2>Professional experience over time</h2>
    <p class="prose">The firm represents clients across a range of areas — civil and commercial litigation, real estate, contractual disputes, and property management — managing each matter strategically and tailoring the legal solution to the client's goals.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/cases/">View All Selected Cases</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Clients</span>
    <h2>Who we represent</h2>
    <p class="prose">Companies, property owners, management companies, entrepreneurs, business owners, and private clients.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/clients/">Clients Page</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container inline-cta">
    <p>{{ strings.en.cta.inlineCta }}</p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/contact/">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>
